% D1-BRANCH: DEFECT 22.  BRANCH (RDEF:943) MAKES A CONSTANT OF .D@, THE
% ABSOLUTE ADDRESS OF THE BRANCH CELL IN THE $EXPREG'D DATA REGION.  IORB<
% WAS MADE WHEN THE REGION WAS AT 7A400 (SHIPPED, V4) OR 80200 (REBUILT);
% ITS CELL IS AT USER_DATA+491.  FLOAT< IS IN THE KERNEL'S USER TABLE AND
% IS R11-RELATIVE.  IN THE SHIPPED EXE IORB< PUSHES A STALE ADDRESS, AND A
% LOOKUP THROUGH IT FAULTS.  IT STAYS ON THE BRANCH STACK, SO EVERY LATER
% LINE FAULTS, ;F INCLUDED, AND STOIC ENDS ONLY AT END OF INPUT.
HEX
"USER_DATA=" MSG USER_DATA @ <#> TYPE "  CELL=" MSG USER_DATA @ 491 + <#> TYPE CR
"IORB< IS " MSG 'IORB< WHERE CR
FLOAT< "FLOAT< PUSHED " MSG VOCAB_SP @ @ <#> TYPE > CR
IORB< "IORB< PUSHED " MSG VOCAB_SP @ @ <#> TYPE > CR
IORB<
"AFTER IORB<" MSG CR
